@rome_menu

- @mobilise_government: We should use our position in government to mobilise all forces agaisnt the <span style="color: [+ pnf_colour +];">fascists</span>!
- @mobilise_no_government: Mobilize our anti-<span style="color: [+ pnf_colour +];">fascist</span> forces!
- @doom_why_select_this: There is nothing we can do.


@rome_adp_mobilise_no_government
max-visits: 1
subtitle: Our forces will begin to March on Rome as well, [? if participating = 1 : in support of the government. ?][? if not_participating = 1: the bourgeois may see this as a threat as well, however. ?]
choose-if: communist_dissent < 50 or maximalist_dissent < 50 or reformist_dissent < 50 or labour_dissent < 50
view-if: arditi_cooperation = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if (communist_dissent >= 50 and maximalist_dissent >= 50 and reformist_dissent >= 50 and labour_dissent >= 50) : The party is too disunited to act. ?]
on-arrival: rome_adp_visited = 1
go-to: rome_menu

Our allied Arditi Del Popolo mobilizes to intercept the Fasci.


@mobilise_no_government
view-if: psi_in_government = 0

- @rome_adp_mobilise_no_government: Mobilise the Arditi Del Popolo to stop [+ pnf_leader +]!

@mobilise_government
view-if: psi_in_government = 1

- @rome_army_mobilise: Mobilise the Army to stop [+ pnf_leader +]!
- @rome_police_mobilise: Mobilise the Carabinieri to stop [+ pnf_leader +]!
- @rome_rg_mobilise: Mobilise the Red Guard to stop [+ pnf_leader +]!
- @rome_adp_mobilise: Mobilise the Arditi del Popolo to stop [+ pnf_leader +]!
- @rome_done: We have done all we can.
- @doom_why_select_this: There is nothing we can do.

@rome_army_mobilise
max-visits: 1
subtitle: The Regio Esercito themselves seem to be willing to cooperate, now we have to convince [+ king +]...
view-if: psi_in_government
on-arrival: army_convinced = 1; rome_army_visited = 1
go-to: rome_army_checks

We send out the order to mobilise the Regio Esercito, but it will require [+ king +]'s authorisation.

@rome_army_checks

- @rome_army_king: Request [+ king +] formally mobilise the army.
- @rome_army_bypass: [+ king +] be damned, mobilise the Regio Esercito already!

@rome_army_king
subtitle: This will result in full mobilisation of the Regio Esercito.
choose-if: king_relation > 59
unavailable-subtitle: [? if king_relation < 60: Our relations with [+ king +] are not high enough, despite our efforts. ?]
on-arrival: army_king_successful = 1; army_king_bypassed = 0
go-to: rome_menu

[+ king +] authorises the order, and the entirely of the Regio Esercito is mobilised.

@rome_army_bypass
subtitle: Bypassing [+ king +] will make many loyalists of him not mobilise at all.
on-arrival: army_king_bypassed = 1; army_king_successful = 0
go-to: rome_menu

[+ king +] refuses to authorise the order, but a number of our loyal forces within the Regio Esercito mobilise regardless.

@rome_police_mobilise
max-visits: 1
subtitle: The Carabinieri themselves seem to be willing to cooperate, now we have to convince [+ king +]...
view-if: psi_in_government
on-arrival: police_convinced = 1; rome_police_visited = 1
go-to: rome_police_checks

We send out the order to mobilise the Carabinieri, but it will require [+ king +]'s authorisation.

@rome_police_checks

- @rome_police_king: Request [+ king +] formally order the Carabinieri to crackdown.
- @rome_police_bypass: [+ king +] be damned, send the orders out to the Carabinieri already!

@rome_police_king
subtitle: This will result in full mobilisation of the Carabinieri.
choose-if: king_relation > 59
unavailable-subtitle: [? if king_relation < 60: Our relations with [+ king +] are not high enough. ?]
on-arrival: police_king_successful = 1; police_king_bypassed = 0
go-to: rome_menu

[+ king + ] authorises the order, and the entirely of the Carabinieri is mobilised.

@rome_police_bypass
subtitle: Bypassing [+ king +] will make many loyalists of him not mobilise at all.
on-arrival: police_king_bypassed = 1; police_king_successful = 0
go-to: rome_menu

[+ king +] refuses to authorise the order, but a number of our loyal forces within the Carabinieri mobilise regardless.

@rome_rg_mobilise
max-visits: 1
subtitle: Our forces will begin to March on Rome as well, [? if participating = 1 : in support of the government. ?][? if participating = 0: potentially escalating the situation to a civil war. ?][? if rg_banned = 1 : The Red Guard is banned, and will be weakened. ?]
choose-if: communist_dissent < 50 or maximalist_dissent < 50 or reformist_dissent < 50 or labour_dissent < 50
unavailable-subtitle: [? if (communist_dissent > 50 and maximalist_dissent > 50 and reformist_dissent > 50 and labour_dissent > 50) : The party is too disunited to act. ?]
on-arrival: rome_rg_visited = 1
go-to: rome_menu if participating == 1 or maximalist_participating == 1; civil_war if not_participating == 1

The Red Guard mobilises on our order, beginning the March to Rome to confront [+ pnf_leader +].

@rome_adp_mobilise
max-visits: 1
subtitle: Our forces will begin to March on Rome as well, [? if participating = 1 : in support of the government. ?][? if not_participating = 1: the bourgeois may see this as a threat as well, however. ?]
choose-if: communist_dissent < 50 or maximalist_dissent < 50 or reformist_dissent < 50 or labour_dissent < 50
view-if: arditi_cooperation = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if (communist_dissent >= 50 and maximalist_dissent >= 50 and reformist_dissent >= 50 and labour_dissent >= 50) : The party is too disunited to act. ?]
on-arrival: rome_adp_visited = 1
go-to: rome_menu

Our allied Arditi Del Popolo mobilizes to intercept the Fasci.
